          ],
          "content": "**14.Observe the pattern below. How many squares will be there in Step 4, Step 10, Step 50? Write a general formula. How would the formula change if we want to count the number of vertices of all the squares?**"
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "bbox": [
            0.248,
            0.153,
            0.796,
            0.291
          ],
          "content": "",
          "captions": [],
