          "bbox": [
            0.115,
            0.313,
            0.458,
            0.332
          ],
          "content": "**Ans:** No. of Squares in Step 4 = 17"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.174,
            0.333,
            0.467,
            0.352
          ],
          "content": "No. of Squares in Step 10 = 41"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.174,
            0.355,
            0.478,
            0.374
          ],
          "content": "No. of Squares in Step 50 = 201"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.174,
            0.378,
            0.597,
            0.397
          ],
          "content": "So, general formula $5+(n-1)\\times4=4n+1$"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.175,
            0.4,
            0.416,
            0.418
          ],
          "content": "No. of vertices = 16n + 4."
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "bbox": [
